# beads issue tracker. Local state, and it stays local: everything bd writes is
# a working copy of a database, so two branches touching it conflict on every
# merge for no gain. Nothing under here is ever committed — not the JSONL
# exports, not the backup directory, not the dolt store. Do not run `bd sync`.
